WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.070
Another thing Dr. Bright is not&nbsp;
allowed to do at the Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:05.530
Dr. Bright! No ordering "The Works"!

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:09.970
The SCP Foundation cafeteria boasts&nbsp;
a wide variety of culinary offerings,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:15.430
from Meatless Mondays and Taco Tuesdays&nbsp;
to a rotating roster of daily soups. What&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:20.350
they don't offer, however, is whatever Dr.&nbsp;
Bright keeps referring to as "the works."

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:24.850
We're not entirely sure what "the works"&nbsp;
consists of, but evidence so far indicates&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:29.950
it might include a root beer float, an entire&nbsp;
lasagna, and a Starbucks gift card. Just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:34.450
get a burger and keep it moving, Doctor.&nbsp;
We've got hungry people in line over here.

